AltoStaking::Constructor()
├── given invalid inputs
│   ├── when lockToken is zero address
│   │   └── it should revert
│   ├── when owner is zero address
│   │   └── it should revert
│   ├── when epochDuration is zero
│   │   └── it should revert
│   ├── when containers length does not match multipliers length
│   │   └── it should revert
│   ├── when container has invalid parameters
│   │   └── it should revert
│   ├── when multiplier is zero
│   │   └── it should revert
│   └── when multiplier is greater than MATH_PRECISION
│       └── it should revert
└── given valid inputs
    ├── when no containers provided
    │   ├── it should set lockToken correctly
    │   ├── it should set owner correctly
    │   ├── it should set epoch duration correctly
    │   ├── it should initialize with zero containers
    │   └── it should emit EpochDurationSet event
    └── when valid containers provided
        ├── it should set lockToken correctly
        ├── it should set owner correctly
        ├── it should set epoch duration correctly
        ├── it should add all containers with correct IDs
        ├── it should set container multipliers correctly
        ├── it should emit EpochDurationSet event
        ├── it should emit ContainerAdded events
        └── it should emit ContainerMultiplierUpdated events 